  "summary": "The experiment tested the pca_n2000 RNA encoder in a multiprofile setup with avgpool aggregation, achieving validation accuracy of 0.5907 and F1 of 0.5727, lower than the scvi_n200 baseline (0.6501 accuracy, 0.6275 F1). This suggests RNA encoder choice may influence performance in multiprofile settings, though other factors like aggregation or profile-level features remain uncertain."
